Always read:
- Documentation/AGENT_CONTEXT.md
- Documentation/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md
- Documentation/CHANGELOG.md

When modifying PBIP:

1. Analyze model first.
2. Explain impact before changing.
3. Update CHANGELOG.md.
4. Keep DAX formatted.
5. Do not delete existing measures unless explicitly requested.
6. Preserve business logic definitions.
7. Use Git commits after each completed task.